class vsTransform3D
    doc From the engine's public source (VS/Math/VS_Transform.h): rotation, then position, then scale.
    doc Its size matches the game: mmoCostumePartDescriptor keeps one at +0x58 and its next field at +0xc4.
    size 0x6c
    field 0x0 m_quaternion vsQuaternion
    field 0x10 m_translation vsVector3D
    field 0x1c m_scale vsVector3D
    field 0x28 m_dirty bool
        doc The cached matrix needs rebuilding.
    field 0x2c m_matrix vsMatrix4x4
